                <zone fixed-size='454' forceUpdate='true' h='7750' id='524' type-v2='text' w='42000' x='727' y='87627'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>指標定義</run>
                    <run fontname='PP Agrandir'> Definition of Metrics</run>
                    <run>
[1] 廣告業績：廣告帶來的訂單業績
[2] 廣告投入比例：廣告成本占總業績百分比
[3] 廣告投報率：廣告業績相對廣告成本的比例
[4] 廣告新客數：藉由廣告吸引的新客（首次下單顧客）數量
（廣告產品包含：熱門推薦 CPC、Pandabox、指定新客折扣 Deal Targeting）</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7750' id='2031' type-v2='text' w='56546' x='42727' y='87627'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='PP Agrandir'>[1] Ads GFV: Total GFV of orders from ads, including CPC, Pandabox, Deal Targeting)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='PP Agrandir'>[2] Ads Cost%: Total Ads cost / Total GFV (Ads cost includes cpc cost, pandabox fee, pandabox voucher value, deal targeting fee, and deal targeting discount value)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='PP Agrandir'>[3] Ads ROI: Ads GFV / Ads Cost Ads cost includes cpc cost, pandabox fee, pandabox voucher value, deal targeting fee, and deal targeting discount value)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='PP Agrandir'>[4] Ads New Customer: Number of new customers attracted through advertising</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
