                <zone fixed-size='520' forceUpdate='true' h='4882' id='9' type-v2='text' w='48000' x='727' y='94647'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontsize='8'>[1] 瀏覽菜單次數：造訪餐廳菜單頁面的瀏覽數</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'>[2] 訂單轉換率：消費者看完您的菜單後，有多少機率會實際下單</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'>[3] 商家轉換率：消費者瀏覽餐廳列表時，有多少機率會點擊進入您的餐廳菜單頁面</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'>[4] 菜單轉換率：消費者看完您的菜單後，有多少機率會加入商品至購物車</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'>[5] 結帳轉換率：消費者加入購物車後，有多少機率會實際結帳下單</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4882' id='1876' type-v2='text' w='50546' x='48727' y='94647'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontname='PP Agrandir' fontsize='8'>Shop Menu Loaded: The number of sessions (visits) to the vendor menu page</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='PP Agrandir' fontsize='8'>CVR: % of sessions with actual transactions ( = transactions / shop menu loaded )</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='PP Agrandir' fontsize='8'>mCVR2: % of sessions goes from shop listing page to shop menu page</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='PP Agrandir' fontsize='8'>mCVR3: % of sessions viewd shop menu page and then added items to shopping cart.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='PP Agrandir' fontsize='8'>mCVR4: % of sessions goes from checkout page to actual order checkout</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
